#: ../../book/announcement.rst:1
msgid ""
"Chapter 1: How China's Announcement No. 48 of 16 October 2026 started two "
"separate clocks, a 30-day public consultation and immediate pre-export "
"registration on ecomp.mofcom.gov.cn."
msgstr ""
"第1章：2026年10月16日发布的商务部与科技部2026年第48号公告如何同时拨动两套时钟：为期30天的公开征求意见，以及在 "
"ecomp.mofcom.gov.cn 即日生效的出口前信息登记。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:5
msgid "01. The Day Knowledge Got a Customs Booth"
msgstr "01. 知识设卡之日：当思想遇上海关岗亭"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:8
msgid "One Friday Afternoon, Two Very Different Clocks"
msgstr "一个周五午后，两套截然不同的时钟"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:11
msgid ""
"Picture a city council announcing on Friday afternoon that it plans to lower"
" the speed limit on forty stretches of highway next winter, and inviting "
"citizens to write in with comments for thirty days. Then read the second "
"half of the notice: starting that same Friday afternoon, a real tollbooth is"
" already open on the highway, recording every covered truck that drives "
"past, including trucks that left the warehouse yesterday and have not yet "
"crossed the bridge."
msgstr ""
"不妨想象这样一幅情景：某个周五午后，市政厅贴出一纸通告，宣布计划在明年入冬前下调四十段高速公路的限速标准，并诚邀市民在三十天内来信建言献策。紧接着再往下读通告的后半截：就在同一个周五下午，高速公路上的实体岗亭已经亮灯运行，开始逐辆登记每一台驶过的受控货车，就连昨天已经驶出仓库、此刻尚未跨过江桥的货车也概莫能外。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:13
msgid ""
"That is almost literally how **Announcement No. 48 of 2026** works. Issued "
"jointly on **16 October 2026** by China's Ministry of Commerce (MOFCOM, led "
"by its Bureau of Industry, Security, Import and Export Control) and the "
"Ministry of Science and Technology (MOST) under China's *Foreign Trade Law* "
"and *Regulations on the Administration of Technology Import and Export*, the"
" document sets two separate clocks ticking at once `CN48, sections I and III"
" "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" `CNTIER <https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_:"
msgstr ""
"这几乎正是  **商务部与科技部2026年第48号公告**  真实的运作方式。  **2026 年 10 月 16 日**  "
"，中国商务部（由商务部安全与管制局牵头承办）会同科学技术部，依据《中华人民共和国对外贸易法》与《中华人民共和国技术进出口管理条例》联合印发这份文件，在同一时刻拨响了两套截然不同的时钟"
" `CN48, sections I and III "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" `CNTIER <https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ ："

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:16
msgid ""
"#import \"figures/diagrams.typ\": two-clocks-timeline\n"
"#two-clocks-timeline(lang: \"en\")"
msgstr ""
"#import \"figures/diagrams.typ\": two-clocks-timeline\n"
"#two-clocks-timeline(lang: \"zh_CN\")"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:16
msgid ""
"Announcement No. 48 splits into two parallel tracks on 16 October 2026: a "
"30-day consultation on 40 proposed catalogue entries, and an immediate pre-"
"export registration mandate on ecomp.mofcom.gov.cn."
msgstr ""
"2026年10月16日发布的第48号公告分出两条并行轨道：针对40项拟新增目录技术为期30天的公开征求意见，以及在 "
"ecomp.mofcom.gov.cn 即日执行的出口前信息登记义务。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:22
msgid ""
"**The Consultation Clock (16 October to 15 November 2026):** Beijing "
"proposes adding **40 technology points** (14 prohibited from export and 26 "
"restricted) across artificial intelligence and chips (23), biomedicine (5), "
"and solar energy (12) to the *Catalogue of Technologies Prohibited or "
"Restricted from Export*. Until the public comment window closes and a final "
"revised catalogue is formally promulgated, those new prohibitions and "
"licensing rules remain **proposals, not final bans** `CN48, sections I and "
"II "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_."
msgstr ""
" **征求意见时钟（2026 年 10 月 16 日至 11 月 15 日）：**  北京拟在《中国禁止出口限制出口技术目录》中新增  **40 "
"项技术管制点** ，包括 14 项禁止出口技术与 26 项限制出口技术，横跨人工智能与芯片（23 项）、生物医药（5 项）以及光伏新能源（12 "
"项）。在公开征求意见期结束、正式修订目录依法公布实施之前，这些新增的禁止与许可条款仍属  **征求意见草案，而非已生效的正式禁令**  `CN48, "
"sections I and II "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" 。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:23
msgid ""
"**The Registration Clock (Running Right Now):** From the moment Announcement"
" 48 went live on 16 October 2026 until the day the final revised catalogue "
"eventually takes effect (a date Beijing has intentionally left unfixed), "
"anyone exporting a technology listed in Attachment 1 must complete **pre-"
"export information registration** online through MOFCOM's Unified Business "
"System Platform at ``https://ecomp.mofcom.gov.cn`` `CN48, section III(1) "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" `CNPLAT <http://jsjckqy.fwmys.mofcom.gov.cn/notice>`_."
msgstr ""
" **信息登记时钟（此刻正在运行）：**  自 2026 年 10 月 16 "
"日第48号公告发布之时起，直至修订后的《中国禁止出口限制出口技术目录》最终正式公布实施之日止（具体实施日期官方尚未设定），凡拟出口附件 1 "
"所列技术的经营主体，均须提前登录商务部业务系统统一平台（ ``https://ecomp.mofcom.gov.cn`` ）在线完成  "
"**出口前信息登记**  `CN48, section III(1) "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" `CNPLAT <http://jsjckqy.fwmys.mofcom.gov.cn/notice>`_ 。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:25
msgid ""
"Confusing those two clocks is the single most common mistake people make "
"when discussing China's new rules. Registration is active today, yet "
"registration is a reporting gate, not an export ban. Conversely, waiting "
"until mid-November to pay attention can catch a startup or university lab "
"off guard if it is signing an overseas license, shipping covered equipment, "
"or closing a foreign financing round right now `CN48 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"将这两套时钟混为一谈，是外界解读中国新规时最常犯的头号误区。出口前信息登记今天确已生效，但它是一道信息报备闸门，而非出口禁令；反过来，倘若一家初创企业或高校实验室误以为一切都要等到十一月中旬以后才算数，而眼下恰在签署境外技术授权协议、发运受控装备或推进境外融资交割，就极易在毫不知情中踩线失措"
" `CN48 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"
" 。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:27
msgid "Crossing a Border Without Packing a Single Crate"
msgstr "不装一个木箱，知识如何跨越国境"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:30
msgid ""
"When our grandparents heard the word *export*, they pictured harbor cranes "
"lifting steel containers onto a cargo ship in Shanghai or Rotterdam. When a "
"modern technology regulator says *export*, not a single wooden crate needs "
"to touch a dock."
msgstr ""
"在我们祖辈的耳中，“出口”二字意味着上海或鹿特丹港口的巨型龙门吊，正将钢铁集装箱稳稳吊上远洋货轮；而在现代技术出口管制立法者的字典里，完成一次“出口”，甚至不需要一只木箱碰到码头的地面。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:32
msgid ""
"Under Section III(2) of Announcement 48, four transactions trigger mandatory"
" pre-export registration before completion, **including transfers that had "
"already started before October 16 but are not yet finished** `CN48, section "
"III(2) "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_:"
msgstr ""
"根据第48号公告第三条第（二）款，四类交易情形必须在行为完成前履行强制性的出口前信息登记， **即便相关跨境转移在 10 月 16 "
"日之前已经启动、但尚未最终交割完成，亦须补办登记**  `CN48, section III(2) "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" ："

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Selling the crown jewels abroad:** Transferring ownership of domestic "
"technology to an overseas buyer, such as assigning patents or selling "
"proprietary model or chip intellectual property."
msgstr " **将核心技术权属卖往境外：**  向境外买方转移境内技术所有权，例如转让专利权，或出售专有大模型、芯片设计等知识产权。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Granting an overseas license:** Keeping ownership in China while licensing"
" a foreign partner, client, or subsidiary to use covered domestic technology"
" outside the country."
msgstr " **授予境外使用许可：**  技术所有权仍留在境内，但许可境外合作伙伴、客户或海外子公司在境外使用受控的境内技术。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Changing who holds the steering wheel:** A corporate acquisition, "
"restructuring, or cap-table shift through which the owner or *actual "
"controller* of domestic technology changes into an overseas entity. Even if "
"every engineer and server stays in Hangzhou or Beijing, if ultimate "
"corporate control crosses the border, the rule engages."
msgstr ""
" **更换手握方向盘的实际控制人：**  通过股权并购、架构重组或股东变更，使境内技术的所有权人或  *实际控制人*  "
"变更为境外主体。哪怕每一位工程师和每一台服务器都纹丝不动地留在杭州或北京，只要最终公司控制权跨过了国境，登记义务便随之触发。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Additional scenarios notified by MOFCOM:** A statutory catch-all allowing "
"the ministry to address new transfer structures by official notice."
msgstr " **商务部通知规定的其他情形：**  一项法定兜底条款，使主管部门可通过正式通知将新型跨境技术转移架构纳入管理。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:39
msgid ""
"When an exporter logs into the Technology Trade Management Information "
"Application on ``ecomp.mofcom.gov.cn`` to file **Attachment 2** (*Technology"
" Export Information Registration Form*), the portal asks for concrete, "
"auditable facts: the exporter's corporate identity and official company seal"
" (``公章``), the technology owner, the foreign recipient's Chinese and English"
" names, country, address, and corporate relationship to the exporter, the "
"exact seven-character catalogue code and technical metrics, the end user and"
" end use, whether the IP is self-developed, and the contract value converted"
" into US dollars `CN-A2 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-2.pdf>`_."
" Multiple technologies transferred to the same overseas partner in one deal "
"may be bundled onto one form; separate partners require separate filings "
"`CN48, section III(3) "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"当出口经营者登录 ``ecomp.mofcom.gov.cn`` 进入“商务部业务系统统一平台 - 技术贸易管理信息应用”填报  **附件 2**  "
"（《技术出口信息登记表》）时，系统要求提供扎实可核验的要素：出口经营者主体信息并加盖单位公章（ ``公章`` "
"）、技术所有权人、境外接收方的中英文名称、所在国别/地区、详细地址及与出口方的关联关系、准确的七位目录编号与控制要点技术指标、最终用户与最终用途、知识产权是否属于自主研发，以及折算为美元的合同金额"
" `CN-A2 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-2.pdf>`_"
" 。同一项目中向同一境外主体出口多项技术的，可合并填报一张登记表；涉及不同境外接收主体的，则须分别单独填报 `CN48, section III(3) "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" 。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:41
msgid "Four Words That Change Everything"
msgstr "决定命运的四个法律档位"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:44
msgid ""
"Legal catalogues look intimidating because casual readers read every line as"
" a \"ban.\" In practice, four regulatory categories carry vastly different "
"meanings for human progress `CN-A1, notes 1 to 4 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"
" `CNTIER <https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_:"
msgstr ""
"法律管制目录之所以常令外行望而生畏，是因为匆匆浏览的读者容易把每一行字都当成“一刀切禁令”。事实上，以下四种监管定位对技术流动与人类进步意味着天壤之别 "
"`CN-A1, notes 1 to 4 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"
" `CNTIER <https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ ："

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:46
msgid "Prohibited (``禁止出口``, codes ending in ``J``)"
msgstr "禁止出口（ ``禁止出口`` ，编号以 ``J`` 结尾）"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:47
msgid ""
"A solid red wall. Once finalized, covered technology within the stated scope"
" cannot legally be exported at all `CNTIER, Art. 32 "
"<https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_."
msgstr ""
"一堵密不透风的红墙。一旦修订目录正式生效，落入控制要点范围内的受控技术依法不得以任何方式出口 `CNTIER, Art. 32 "
"<https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ 。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:49
msgid "Restricted (``限制出口``, codes ending in ``X``)"
msgstr "限制出口（ ``限制出口`` ，编号以 ``X`` 结尾）"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:50
msgid ""
"A guarded gate with a lock and a key. Export is lawful, provided the "
"exporter obtains official government permission before transferring the "
"technology `CNTIER, Art. 33 "
"<https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_."
msgstr ""
"一道配有锁孔与钥匙的守卫闸门。技术并非不可出海，只要出口经营者在跨境转移前依法取得商务与科技主管部门签发的许可文件，出口即完全合法 `CNTIER, "
"Art. 33 <https://xzfg.moj.gov.cn/front/law/detail?LawID=898>`_ 。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:52
msgid "Automatic licensing (``自动许可``)"
msgstr "自动许可（ ``自动许可`` ）"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:53
msgid ""
"Proposed facilitation for specified restricted exports. MOFCOM describes the"
" intended process as nearly immediate, but this is distinct from an "
"exclusion and does not itself provide a final procedure or a guaranteed "
"approval time. `CN-A1, notes 2 and 3 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"指定限制出口拟享便利。官方意图加快办理，但不等于排除，也未给出最终流程或保证审批时间。 `CN-A1, notes 2 and 3 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:55
msgid "Excluded (``不纳入管理范围``)"
msgstr "不纳入管理范围（ ``不纳入管理范围`` ）"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:56
msgid ""
"Outside this catalogue altogether. Already-public open-source AI and "
"published academic papers sit here under Footnote 1, while ordinary laws "
"like data security or copyright remain in place `CN-A1, note 1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_."
msgstr ""
"完全处于本目录管辖之外。根据注释 1，已通过开源或公开发表论文进入公共领域的人工智能技术即归于此类（数据安全、著作权等一般性法律法规仍照常适用） "
"`CN-A1, note 1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" 。"

#: ../../book/announcement.rst:58
msgid ""
"Think of it like an international airport: *prohibited* items cannot fly; "
"*restricted* items need a declared export permit; *automatic licensing* is "
"the fast-track e-gate; and *excluded* items stay in your backpack without "
"stopping at customs."
msgstr ""
"不妨把它想象成一座国际机场：  *禁止出口*  物品严禁登机；  *限制出口*  物品须凭申报批件放行；  *自动许可*  "
"如同刷证秒过的自助快捷通道；而  *不纳入管理范围*  的物品则安稳留在你的随身背包里，连海关申报台都无需驻足。"
